@host = http://localhost:5136

### The grid, most urgent first (FR-01, FR-02)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/medicines?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Search by name (FR-07)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/medicines?search=amox
Accept: application/json

### Sort by soonest expiry
GET {{host}}/api/v1/medicines?sortBy=expiryDate&sortDir=asc

### Dashboard counts
GET {{host}}/api/v1/medicines/summary

### Add a medicine (FR-03)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/medicines
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Paracetamol 500mg Tablet",
  "notes": "Store below 25 C. Blister pack of 10.",
  "expiryDate": "2027-11-30",
  "quantity": 250,
  "price": 3.40,
  "brand": "HealWell"
}

### The same name and brand again - expect 409 problem+json
POST {{host}}/api/v1/medicines
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Paracetamol 500mg Tablet",
  "notes": null,
  "expiryDate": "2028-01-31",
  "quantity": 10,
  "price": 3.40,
  "brand": "HealWell"
}

### Record a sale (FR-06) - replace the id with one from the grid
POST {{host}}/api/v1/sales
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lines": [
    { "medicineId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "quantity": 2 }
  ],
  "soldBy": "Nimal",
  "notes": "Counter sale"
}

### Sales history
GET {{host}}/api/v1/sales?page=1&pageSize=10

### Health
GET {{host}}/health
